  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>Z located horizontally to the right of Y ✓  Correct overall shape ✓<br/><br/>Arrows not required.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_03\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 3\" src=\"asset:fig_03\"/></figure></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{0.1\\times 1.2\\times 10^{-3}}{0.48}\"></span>   Accept BCA if given to 3sf.</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c.i\"><p><strong>c.i</strong></p><p>Line 1 correct ✓ Line 3 correct ✓ Lines 2 and 4 correct ✓</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_04\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 4\" src=\"asset:fig_04\"/></figure></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c.ii\"><p><strong>c.ii</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W=105=pV_{Z}-V_{Y}\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=0.48\\times 10^{6}\\times V_{Z}-0.25\\times 10^{-3}\"></span> so <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V_{Z}=0.47\\times 10^{-3}\"></span> «m<sup>3</sup>» ✓<br/><br/>Award [2] for a BCA. Award [2] for correct use of the adiabatic equation.</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c.iii\"><p><strong>c.iii</strong></p><p>Uses 4<sup>th</sup> row of Q and 2<sup>nd</sup> row of Q for working values ✓ η = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{74}{262}\"></span> = 0.28 or 28 % ✓<br/><br/>Allow ECF from incorrect values in table. Award 0 if η ≥ 1 OR 100 %. Award [2] for a BCA.</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"d\"><p><strong>d</strong></p><p>Isothermal process needs engine to run very (infinitely) slowly ✓ Adiabatic process needs engine to run very (infinitely) quickly OR requires insulation ✓<br/><br/>Treat reference to frictional and other dissipative losses as neutral.</p></section>"
